"hp": 8, "atk": 6, "defense": 1, "move": 4, "range": 1, "entry": {"shield": 2, "refresh_move": true},
"text": "部署时为自身与相邻友军各加2护盾，上限5。\n已走未打、可行动的相邻普通部队可再走。", "tag": "骑兵 · 进场开路"
}, {
"id": "last_bridge_clinic", "name": "长桥总医官", "short": "医", "type": "unit", "kind": "healer", "cost": 9, "set_id": "afterglow",
"hp": 8, "atk": 3, "defense": 1, "move": 2, "range": 2, "entry": {"radius": 2, "healing": 3, "cleanse": true}, "fall": {"shield": 2},
"text": "部署时为2格内友军恢复3生命并解开定身。\n阵亡时相邻友军各获2护盾，上限5。", "tag": "医师 · 救援与殿后"
}, {
"id": "oath_deliberation", "name": "两灯合议", "short": "议", "type": "spell", "effect": "formation", "target_side": "ally", "radius": 2, "healing": 4, "draw": 2, "cost": 9, "set_id": "afterglow",
"text": "距目标格2格内所有友军恢复4生命，\n然后抽最多2张库中牌。范围内须有受伤友军。", "tag": "法术 · 广域救援"
}, {
"id": "copper_gate_requiem", "name": "铜闸送行官", "short": "法", "type": "unit", "kind": "mage", "cost": 10, "set_id": "afterglow",
"hp": 6, "atk": 4, "defense": 0, "move": 2, "range": 3, "entry": {"target_side": "enemy", "damage": 4, "commander_damage": 2, "root": true}, "fall": {"draw": 1},
"text": "部署时对相邻敌军造成4伤害，指挥官受2伤害；存活普通部队定身至其下个回合结束。\n阵亡时若牌库有牌，抽1张。", "tag": "法师 · 进场截阵"
}, {
